WEBVTT

00:11.545 --> 00:14.776
Hanaukyo Maid Team

00:15.549 --> 00:21.146
Open a window in the morning.

00:21.221 --> 00:28.150
Flowers of light
surround the world.

00:29.196 --> 00:35.101
As if the hidden
feeling in my heart...

00:35.169 --> 00:42.041
...is melting away now.

00:43.177 --> 00:48.114
I'm holding
the fragrance of the season.

00:49.550 --> 00:55.785
I wish for you...

00:55.856 --> 00:58.825
I wanted to meet you...

00:58.892 --> 01:02.589
...ever since the day I was born.

01:02.663 --> 01:05.496
Only you...

01:05.566 --> 01:09.969
...I want to protect only you.

01:10.037 --> 01:12.335
Just you...

01:12.406 --> 01:14.374
...I want to touch.

01:15.709 --> 01:20.772
My hand holding yours.

01:22.482 --> 01:24.541
I want to deliver.

01:25.853 --> 01:28.048
Voice of my heart.

01:32.226 --> 01:34.217
- Ring, ring!
- Taro-sama!

01:34.294 --> 01:35.261
Morning...

01:35.329 --> 01:37.627
...kiss time!

01:39.166 --> 01:40.133
Ta-dah!

01:41.101 --> 01:42.068
Huh?

01:50.677 --> 01:51.644
All right...

01:53.680 --> 01:54.647
Yes!

01:57.551 --> 01:58.848
Taro-sama!

01:58.919 --> 02:00.648
Are you up already?

02:01.321 --> 02:02.379
Yeah...

02:02.456 --> 02:04.447
I was nervous
and couldn't sleep...

02:05.692 --> 02:08.286
No, I woke up early...

02:09.263 --> 02:11.254
Would you like
to have breakfast?

02:11.331 --> 02:12.855
No, I'm fine.

02:13.600 --> 02:14.999
Um...

02:15.068 --> 02:16.365
Mariel...

02:16.436 --> 02:17.403
Yes?

02:17.471 --> 02:20.872
This Sunday, can you
make some time?

02:22.442 --> 02:24.967
I want to go out with you, Mariel...

02:27.514 --> 02:28.606
Yes.

02:28.682 --> 02:31.276
If it's all right
with you, Taro-sama.

02:31.351 --> 02:36.288
The First Date

02:36.356 --> 02:37.789
You cannot.

02:37.858 --> 02:39.189
But...

02:39.259 --> 02:42.422
Have you forgotten
the incident in Kamakura?

02:42.496 --> 02:43.793
That was...

02:43.864 --> 02:46.389
I'm dwelling upon my actions, too.

02:46.466 --> 02:49.765
Perhaps I've been too
lenient about security lately.

02:50.570 --> 02:54.301
But I just want to talk
to Mariel for a little bit.

02:55.342 --> 02:57.310
I'll return by evening.

02:57.377 --> 02:59.743
You said the same thing
the other day, too.

03:01.248 --> 03:02.374
Please go.

03:03.383 --> 03:04.407
You're right...

03:05.452 --> 03:06.817
I'm sorry for being selfish.

03:09.156 --> 03:10.646
Taro-sama...

03:10.724 --> 03:12.521
I am very sorry.

03:16.930 --> 03:19.023
She's sound asleep, isn't she?

03:19.866 --> 03:23.097
Grace seems to be
working hard these days, too.

03:24.304 --> 03:25.794
Let her sleep.

03:28.375 --> 03:31.503
I thought I wouldn't trouble
Konoe-san if we're here...

03:31.578 --> 03:34.376
...and I could talk
to Mariel alone, but...

03:35.615 --> 03:37.515
Still, I'm nervous...

03:41.955 --> 03:45.049
But I have to tell her
since this is a rare chance...

03:47.094 --> 03:48.618
Um...

03:48.695 --> 03:51.664
To tell the truth, or just...

03:52.699 --> 03:54.496
I want to ask you a question...

03:55.535 --> 03:58.402
You may be surprised
to hear this all of a sudden.

03:58.472 --> 03:59.530
But...

03:59.606 --> 04:01.267
Um...

04:01.341 --> 04:02.638
Well...

04:02.709 --> 04:03.676
Mariel...

04:20.160 --> 04:21.218
She's warm...

04:23.764 --> 04:25.061
Taro-sama?

04:25.899 --> 04:26.991
W-Well...

04:27.067 --> 04:28.557
When did I...

04:29.436 --> 04:30.698
I'm sorry.

04:30.771 --> 04:33.069
N-No, it's all right.

04:34.374 --> 04:35.341
Um...

04:37.778 --> 04:39.177
Ryu...

04:39.846 --> 04:41.973
What's with the good mood?

04:42.049 --> 04:43.038
You midget.

04:43.116 --> 04:45.107
Midget, midget, midget, midget!

04:48.288 --> 04:52.156
I'm gracious enough
to offer to become your wife.

04:52.225 --> 04:55.194
How dare you be infatuated
with another woman?!

04:55.262 --> 04:57.162
This is flirting.

04:57.230 --> 04:58.197
It's illicit.

04:58.265 --> 05:00.529
It's adultery!

05:00.600 --> 05:03.091
B-But we haven't
gotten married...

05:05.505 --> 05:09.339
Is this the mouth that's talking
back to me? Is this the mouth?

05:11.011 --> 05:11.978
Take that!

05:13.013 --> 05:15.709
Mariel! What do you
think you're doing?

05:15.782 --> 05:18.148
If you want Taro...

05:18.218 --> 05:21.585
...isn't it reasonable to settle
it with me completely first?

05:21.655 --> 05:23.486
But this...

05:23.557 --> 05:25.218
Um, Ryuka-san...

05:25.292 --> 05:26.224
What?

05:26.293 --> 05:27.692
Behind you...

05:28.295 --> 05:29.262
Behind?

05:29.930 --> 05:31.693
Ikuyossie!

05:39.039 --> 05:41.940
There's something
like this in this lake?

05:43.610 --> 05:44.668
No way.

05:45.979 --> 05:46.946
Ikuyo-chan?

05:47.013 --> 05:49.982
It's an amphibious
machine I developed.

05:50.050 --> 05:51.779
Ikuyossie Number One!

05:53.153 --> 05:54.711
How is it?

05:54.788 --> 05:56.619
"H-How is it?"

05:57.657 --> 05:59.682
That's what it's all about.

06:00.927 --> 06:03.122
Oh, that was quick.

06:03.196 --> 06:06.723
That time at softball and during
the underground exploration...

06:06.800 --> 06:10.896
You're a mere maid
of the Hanaukyo family!

06:10.971 --> 06:14.634
You've insulted the Jihioh family's
next head countless times!

06:14.708 --> 06:16.676
You're going to atone for it today!

06:16.743 --> 06:20.304
How dare you say such
things in this situation?

06:20.380 --> 06:22.473
Let's go, Ikuyossie!

06:22.549 --> 06:24.574
Ikuyossie!

06:25.185 --> 06:26.174
That's nothing!

06:29.489 --> 06:31.957
It's not a good time
to talk anymore...

06:33.927 --> 06:36.657
Mariel is always beside me.

06:37.597 --> 06:41.863
But we rarely have a chance
to talk alone inside the mansion...

06:43.737 --> 06:45.261
Everyone is in the room.

06:46.139 --> 06:47.436
During meals, too.

06:48.475 --> 06:49.874
During baths, too.

06:51.411 --> 06:52.935
Even at bedtime...

06:54.881 --> 06:56.644
Then good night.

07:00.020 --> 07:01.715
What should I do?

07:06.226 --> 07:07.921
Well? Not possible yet?

07:08.528 --> 07:09.825
Take it easy.

07:09.896 --> 07:14.799
The barrier's set to destroy data
if I force it open unreasonably.

07:14.868 --> 07:15.926
But...

07:16.002 --> 07:16.969
This is...

07:17.037 --> 07:17.935
...bingo!

07:21.041 --> 07:22.338
They're codes.

07:23.176 --> 07:24.473
Don't worry.

07:24.544 --> 07:27.945
Once I've come this far,
I'll decode them all by morning.

07:33.153 --> 07:35.018
Did you hear about Taro-sama?

07:36.022 --> 07:37.887
He wants to date Mariel-sama...

07:37.958 --> 07:40.688
...but this security staff
one won't let him.

07:40.760 --> 07:41.749
"This one"...

07:41.828 --> 07:44.296
You mean this, this, and this?

07:44.364 --> 07:45.524
No.

07:45.599 --> 07:48.033
This, this, and this, right?

07:48.101 --> 07:50.262
You girls...

07:53.707 --> 07:56.767
Don't call Konoe-shama "this"!

07:56.843 --> 07:58.071
Wait! Hey!

07:58.545 --> 07:59.813
I said come here!

07:59.813 --> 08:00.947
I said come here!
Date?

08:00.947 --> 08:01.548
Don't run!
Date?

08:01.548 --> 08:02.148
Don't run!
Taro-sama and me...

08:02.148 --> 08:03.750
Apologize! Apologize!
Taro-sama and me...

08:03.750 --> 08:05.252
Apologize! Apologize!
With a splendid mustache...

08:05.252 --> 08:08.244
With a splendid mustache...

08:08.321 --> 08:11.290
...and muscles, macho... There.

08:11.358 --> 08:12.916
Oh, Mariel-sama.

08:13.526 --> 08:15.858
Um, who are you?

08:17.030 --> 08:18.497
Oh, no...

08:18.565 --> 08:19.896
It's me.

08:23.536 --> 08:24.901
So it's Ikuyo-san.

08:26.339 --> 08:27.897
What's wrong?

08:29.309 --> 08:31.800
Um, I have a favor to ask...

08:41.955 --> 08:43.752
It's too early...

08:45.091 --> 08:46.854
Let me sleep a little more...

08:46.926 --> 08:48.416
M-Mariel.

08:49.696 --> 08:52.164
Taro-sama, let's go out now.

08:57.604 --> 08:59.003
You're kidding...

08:59.072 --> 09:01.905
This is Mariel's true identity...

09:03.710 --> 09:05.302
Leader, emergency!

09:05.378 --> 09:06.402
Taro-sama is...

09:16.489 --> 09:20.186
But was it really
all right to go out?

09:20.260 --> 09:26.893
Yes, I asked Ikuyo-san to explain
it to Konoe-san and the others.

09:26.966 --> 09:30.026
Besides, it seemed
you desired to go out...

09:30.103 --> 09:32.435
Well, that is true, but...

09:33.807 --> 09:35.968
It's a lively place, isn't it?

09:36.042 --> 09:38.442
You don't come to town often?

09:38.511 --> 09:40.001
No.

09:40.080 --> 09:42.105
Hey, that's a maid uniform.

09:42.182 --> 09:44.241
Are they shooting
some kind of film?

09:45.285 --> 09:47.412
Is there something
wrong with me?

09:48.521 --> 09:50.455
First, the clothes...

09:50.523 --> 09:53.424
Grand sale

09:55.995 --> 09:56.962
Well?

10:03.503 --> 10:04.595
How is it?

10:05.238 --> 10:06.830
Yeah...

10:06.906 --> 10:08.737
It looks very nice.

10:08.808 --> 10:09.934
Really?

10:14.047 --> 10:18.677
Hanaukyo Maid Team

10:19.319 --> 10:21.048
You great fool!

10:21.121 --> 10:22.756
So were you the mastermind?

10:22.756 --> 10:23.056
Be back by this evening.
Taro
So were you the mastermind?

10:23.056 --> 10:24.683
Be back by this evening.
Taro
Helping the two go out?

10:24.758 --> 10:27.090
You bastard...

10:28.128 --> 10:29.959
"Mastermind"...That's awful!

10:30.029 --> 10:32.759
Taro-sama wanted to go out.

10:32.832 --> 10:35.767
Even for a security chief,
you're too strict!

10:35.835 --> 10:37.496
You bastards...

10:38.772 --> 10:41.172
Speaking freely
against the leader...

10:41.241 --> 10:42.538
I won't forgive you!

10:43.777 --> 10:45.540
Mariel...

10:45.612 --> 10:48.103
I told her that much...

10:48.181 --> 10:51.947
But how dare she
get the jump on me...

10:55.288 --> 10:57.119
International Aquarium

11:05.231 --> 11:08.598
Look, this fish is just like Cynthia.

11:08.668 --> 11:11.136
Then the one next to it
is Grace-chan, right?

11:12.639 --> 11:15.130
This one's like Ikuyo-chan...

11:15.708 --> 11:18.108
It says it likes dark places, too...

11:22.182 --> 11:23.774
We were scolded.

11:23.850 --> 11:25.511
That's Konoe-san, isn't it?

11:26.186 --> 11:27.153
Yes.

11:40.633 --> 11:42.191
Mariel, thanks for wait...

11:51.311 --> 11:52.278
Um...

11:59.452 --> 12:00.544
Taro-sama...

12:00.620 --> 12:03.180
Mariel, you like headfish, don't you?

12:03.256 --> 12:04.348
Yes.

12:11.197 --> 12:13.961
Women's intuition twinges sharply.

12:14.033 --> 12:16.593
They're undoubtedly
around here...

12:17.770 --> 12:18.862
Hey, miss.

12:19.506 --> 12:21.167
You touched me, didn't you?

12:23.576 --> 12:26.340
Come, give me those eyeballs.

12:28.047 --> 12:31.414
I will crush them very softly...

12:33.486 --> 12:35.386
Commoners like you...

12:37.023 --> 12:38.251
That was just...

12:38.324 --> 12:39.291
Move!

12:51.504 --> 12:53.802
Um, like this here...

12:55.008 --> 12:57.340
You let the ball go here.

12:58.912 --> 12:59.844
See?

12:59.913 --> 13:01.881
Yes. I'll try it.

13:04.918 --> 13:05.885
There!

13:10.924 --> 13:11.891
Taro
Mariel

13:13.126 --> 13:15.424
I did it, Taro-sama!

13:15.495 --> 13:17.190
Y-Yeah...

13:23.469 --> 13:26.302
I found them.

13:26.372 --> 13:30.274
They're making out that much...
I won't forgive them!

13:32.045 --> 13:33.444
Hey, midget!

13:33.513 --> 13:35.140
Then like last time.

13:35.214 --> 13:36.044
Yes.

13:37.016 --> 13:38.244
One more time.

13:42.789 --> 13:45.553
You have good guts, don't you?

13:45.625 --> 13:48.116
Did you think
you could escape me...

13:48.194 --> 13:49.286
You did it!

13:49.362 --> 13:50.886
Yes, Taro-sama!

13:51.664 --> 13:52.892
Listen to me!

13:53.666 --> 13:55.998
It's a double, Mariel.

13:56.069 --> 13:57.161
You're great!

13:57.236 --> 13:58.203
Lis...

14:03.242 --> 14:05.107
Great, great, Mariel!

14:05.178 --> 14:07.305
It's a turkey, a turkey. You know?

14:08.514 --> 14:09.481
You're great!

14:14.954 --> 14:15.921
What's wrong?

14:17.056 --> 14:20.355
I felt like someone
was here just now...

14:26.199 --> 14:29.066
I got a good souvenir
for Cynthia-chan.

14:30.203 --> 14:31.397
Let's go there.

14:35.108 --> 14:38.339
I thought we could watch
a beautiful sunset here.

14:39.712 --> 14:42.442
But the fence is
in the way, isn't it?

14:42.515 --> 14:45.484
Well, this is
beautiful enough, too...

14:46.386 --> 14:47.546
Taro-sama!

14:50.256 --> 14:53.157
Climb up here,
and you can see the view!

14:54.227 --> 14:55.626
Mariel, you can't!

14:57.363 --> 14:58.853
Did I do something wrong?

15:09.042 --> 15:10.669
Today was fun, huh?

15:10.743 --> 15:12.176
Yes.

15:12.245 --> 15:15.408
Mariel, what did
you enjoy the most?

15:15.481 --> 15:16.607
Let's see...

15:17.950 --> 15:20.145
Was it seeing
the headfish, after all?

15:20.887 --> 15:22.855
You may be right...

15:22.922 --> 15:27.154
Somehow, I thought
it looked like you, Taro-sama...

15:34.267 --> 15:35.564
Mariel...

15:35.635 --> 15:37.227
Yes?

15:37.303 --> 15:38.429
Mariel...

15:39.572 --> 15:41.130
Do you like me?

15:45.511 --> 15:48.071
That's the question I wanted...

15:49.115 --> 15:50.241
...to ask...

15:51.250 --> 15:53.810
I like you very much.

15:53.886 --> 15:54.750
Really?

15:54.821 --> 15:55.788
Yes.

15:59.826 --> 16:00.986
Taro-sama!

16:18.244 --> 16:19.506
Well...

16:19.579 --> 16:22.673
I-I'm going to buy
juice or something...

16:22.749 --> 16:23.875
I can go...

16:24.984 --> 16:26.042
I'm all right.

16:28.321 --> 16:29.913
It's getting cloudy...

16:34.127 --> 16:35.458
Honestly.

16:35.528 --> 16:36.893
I can't watch you.

16:37.764 --> 16:38.924
Ryuka-san...

16:38.998 --> 16:43.025
That flakey man isn't qualified
to be my husband, after all.

16:43.903 --> 16:45.393
It's divorce.

16:45.471 --> 16:46.802
It's separation.

16:46.873 --> 16:47.897
It's the end.

16:49.208 --> 16:50.402
Is that so?

16:51.010 --> 16:52.500
"Is that so?"

16:52.578 --> 16:54.068
Don't tell me that.

16:55.114 --> 16:56.911
Taro is free now.

16:57.550 --> 17:00.144
You can become
Taro's lover, wife...

17:00.219 --> 17:02.187
...or anything you like.

17:04.791 --> 17:09.057
M-Make sure to support
that midget and love him.

17:11.364 --> 17:13.798
Despite his appearance...

17:13.866 --> 17:16.164
...he gets lonely easily.

17:22.441 --> 17:23.499
Um...

17:23.576 --> 17:25.635
May I ask you one thing?

17:26.379 --> 17:27.710
What?

17:27.780 --> 17:31.648
Is that what Taro-sama desired?

17:33.486 --> 17:35.613
I am Taro-sama's maid.

17:36.422 --> 17:41.155
It is my duty to serve
Taro-sama as he desires.

17:41.227 --> 17:43.354
If Taro-sama doesn't desire it...

17:45.364 --> 17:46.626
Then tell me...

17:46.699 --> 17:49.930
When we fought for
the position of Taro's wife...

17:50.002 --> 17:53.233
...you said you wouldn't
lose to me, didn't you?

17:53.306 --> 17:54.637
What was that about?

17:55.474 --> 17:58.637
Because Taro-sama
seemed to desire that...

17:59.579 --> 18:02.207
T-Then at
the softball tournament...

18:02.281 --> 18:05.341
...when you blasted
a home run and hugged Taro?

18:05.418 --> 18:08.649
Because Taro-sama
seemed to desire that...

18:09.522 --> 18:13.151
Then what about the two
of you sneaking out today?

18:15.528 --> 18:18.656
Because I heard
Taro-sama desired so...

18:25.605 --> 18:26.731
Taro-sama...

18:30.243 --> 18:32.473
C-Cynthia?

18:44.924 --> 18:50.385
You told me you liked me
because I desired that answer.

18:51.264 --> 18:52.162
Yes.

18:53.866 --> 18:56.596
Mariel, you're always like that.

18:57.503 --> 18:58.527
Taro-sama...

19:00.406 --> 19:02.397
My desires don't matter.

19:02.475 --> 19:04.170
I want to know your feelings.

19:05.044 --> 19:06.602
Taro-sama...

19:07.713 --> 19:11.706
What I wanted to hear wasn't
a shallow answer like that.

19:12.585 --> 19:13.609
The true...

19:15.187 --> 19:17.621
What kind of answer do you desire?

19:19.725 --> 19:20.851
Mariel...

19:23.162 --> 19:25.722
Please tell me your desire.

19:25.798 --> 19:27.629
I will follow it.

19:33.406 --> 19:36.637
You really are at
my beck and call, aren't you?

19:36.709 --> 19:38.336
Then...

19:38.411 --> 19:40.971
If I tell you to hate me...

19:41.047 --> 19:42.844
...are you going to hate me?

19:44.283 --> 19:47.116
If that is what you desire, Taro-sama.

19:47.853 --> 19:51.152
Then if I tell you to get
out of my sight, would you?

19:51.223 --> 19:53.919
If that is what
you desire, Taro-sama!

20:00.800 --> 20:02.392
Taro-sama...

20:02.468 --> 20:06.131
Did I say something
to hurt your feelings?

20:07.173 --> 20:08.572
Don't worry.

20:09.542 --> 20:11.874
I won't tell you
to get out of my sight.

20:12.912 --> 20:14.743
I'll get out of yours.

20:19.685 --> 20:22.620
Taro-sama's desire is my desire.

20:23.389 --> 20:25.016
Taro-sama's desire is...

20:26.892 --> 20:27.859
...my...

20:30.296 --> 20:31.388
My...

20:37.737 --> 20:39.830
Taro-sama! Taro-sama!

20:39.905 --> 20:41.372
Where's Mariel-sama?

20:43.642 --> 20:45.337
Where is Mariel-sama?

20:45.411 --> 20:46.639
It's an emergency situation!

20:48.247 --> 20:50.545
Cynthia-sama has been insisting...

20:50.616 --> 20:53.710
...that Mariel-sama is going
to break, going to break...

20:53.786 --> 20:55.777
...since earlier...

20:55.855 --> 20:57.584
Mariel is...

20:57.656 --> 20:59.123
...going to break?

21:15.241 --> 21:19.143
Perfect Game

21:46.038 --> 21:49.337
Please leave everything to us.

21:49.408 --> 21:51.535
Hanaukyo Maid Team.

21:52.578 --> 21:55.741
We're going to take care of you.

21:55.815 --> 21:58.909
Your private personal team.

21:58.984 --> 22:02.078
Always to match your taste.

22:02.154 --> 22:04.452
We're highly motivated.

22:05.424 --> 22:08.587
We polish our minds and bodies.

22:08.661 --> 22:11.596
Tell us anything.

22:11.664 --> 22:23.269
Just want you to be
pleased, to be pleased.

22:24.310 --> 22:34.914
But, but,
what a cold-hearted man.

22:37.156 --> 22:43.288
Look, the stars are beautiful.

22:43.362 --> 22:49.130
Tomorrow sure
will be sunny, too.

22:50.002 --> 22:56.305
